# Real nono binary staged into build contexts by the swarm-*-nono-image
# Makefile targets (cp "$(command -v nono)" .../nono.real). It is ~30 MB,
# host-specific, and must never be committed — it is staged at build time and a
# network fetch mid-build would be non-hermetic.
**/nono.real

# Compiled Go binaries that `go build ./...` drops into a main-package dir
# during local verification. Build artifacts, never committed.
apps/cpai-engineer/cpai-engineer
apps/nono-containment-probe/nono-containment-probe
